{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two kings came together in a deadly battle. Your task is to destroy the enemy monarch while yours is still alive. Build defenses, hire mercenaries, and set deadly traps. But be prepared \u2014 the enemy will not remain in debt! They can attack in hordes or with sophisticated tactics: clone after death, hack in close combat, or shoot from afar. Every decision matters. One wrong step and the throne will be empty. Think over your strategy, use your resources wisely, and your king will stand up to the onslaught of the enemy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The king is dead, long live the king!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre of the game - tactics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waves of enemies</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"LEVEL 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3807920/678511540229d24807e3b8270d50ce688651ae68.jpg"},{"name":"LEVEL 15","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3807920/fbf917cb0c5cac901a8fca186d80b9b873a2ee5e.jpg"},{"name":"LEVEL 25","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3807920/118ff7e85a92bb2ba69ed6e748c55a70f80fd6b6.jpg"},{"name":"LEVEL 35","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3807920/7784d68b5616bc52225d98f011cc4e00aca34816.jpg"},{"name":"LEVEL 50","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3807920/83478ab4351f07cf23e0ace0297a94d719829f8e.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/imag